      "filename": "Ex-Kobe streetcar 578 turning into SF Transbay Terminal in 1987.jpg",
      "title": "File:Ex-Kobe streetcar 578 turning into SF Transbay Terminal in 1987.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Ex-Kobe_streetcar_578_turning_into_SF_Transbay_Terminal_in_1987.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
